                                                "sense_id": "3fca16e8-6e9e-3ddc-9a1a-5fed39e49ef1",
                                                "text": "Stories of ghosting often deal with broken-off romances, but it's worth mentioning that friend ghosting is real, and sometimes necessary."
                                            }
                                        ]
